{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Your friend Toby is upset that you\u2019re moving and now won\u2019t let you leave. Uncover secrets hidden around your house to stop Toby and finally put an end to this friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself ready before the lights go out.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/0753cd6eafd56ebf19b0485d2fb12e43.poster.avif?t=1764301937\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/0753cd6eafd56ebf19b0485d2fb12e43.webm?t=1764301937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/0753cd6eafd56ebf19b0485d2fb12e43.mp4?t=1764301937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your step!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepping on hard surfaces could grab unwanted attention.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/81a97341a85a45644390fe9cd8cdf444.poster.avif?t=1764301937\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/81a97341a85a45644390fe9cd8cdf444.webm?t=1764301937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/81a97341a85a45644390fe9cd8cdf444.mp4?t=1764301937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can\u2019t run forever!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Inhaler has limited puffs, so use it sparingly to keep your stamina accumulating quick eno